1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:14,150
The federal counts punish interstate and online stalking. New York's murder charge punishes an intentional killing here. Our law allows an exception for different harms.

2
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:29,520
His federal plea covers Brian Ward's intentional killing too. The stalking led to the shooting. It's one course of conduct.

3
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:44,430
You're relying on New York's protection for the same criminal transaction, not a blanket federal ban?

4
00:00:45,080 --> 00:00:46,140
Correct.

5
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:58,330
The same death appears in both. That doesn't make the harms identical.

6
00:00:58,980 --> 00:01:03,410
The exception still has to fit this conduct.

7
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:20,150
On this record, the federal convictions addressed the same death in the same criminal transaction. Under our state law, the claimed exception does not apply.

8
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:34,000
The listed murder and duplicative firearm counts are dismissed. The federal convictions remain. The defendant is not being released.

9
00:01:39,800 --> 00:01:47,140
For knowingly possessing a forged identification document in New York, how do you plead?

10
00:01:47,790 --> 00:02:00,200
Guilty. I had the ID in New York. I knew it was forged. I understand the rights I'm giving up. No one's forced me.

11
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:10,950
The plea is accepted. The agreed sentence on this count is time served. It adds no custody.

12
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:12,880
I understand.

13
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:31,430
On the way back, someone yelled I was going home. They really think I'm getting out.

14
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:43,850
No. We're done in New York. Pennsylvania's own order says time served. No more custody there. This one's your federal sentencing notice.

15
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:51,280
That's your sentencing date. We haven't agreed on a sentence.

16
00:02:51,930 --> 00:03:01,080
My sister's taken two days off. Can you confirm a visit before she pays for the tickets?

17
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:13,230
I'll check tomorrow. Don't fill that in yet.

18
00:03:13,880 --> 00:03:24,080
Tell her to wait on the tickets. And make sure she knows it's a visit. I'm not getting out.

19
00:03:24,730 --> 00:03:26,540
I'll tell her.
